# ===== Training outputs (257GB: checkpoints / val images / tb events) =====
# These stay on the training server only — re-generate by resuming training.
# (2026-09-18: the blanket dir-exclusion below BLOCKED main/.gitignore's
#  fine-grained text-record negations — a parent-dir exclusion cannot be
#  re-included from a deeper .gitignore. Delegated to main/.gitignore now:
#  experiments/** minus *.json/*.txt/*.log/*.md/*.csv/*.yaml/*.yml .)
# warpgan-diffusion-inpainting-main/experiments/

# ===== Bundle info sidecar files (server-local, created next to bundles) =====
BUNDLE_INFO_*.txt

# ===== Archives (redundant copies) =====
*.zip
*.tar.gz

# ===== Old pre-migration backups =====
**/_backup_pre_mirror_anchor/

# ===== Git bundle artifacts =====
*.bundle

# ===== Python =====
__pycache__/
*.pyc
*.pyo
*.egg-info/
.ipynb_checkpoints/

# ===== OS / IDE =====
.DS_Store
Thumbs.db
.vscode/
.idea/

# ===== Misc runtime artifacts =====
nohup.out
*.log.tmp
